# Compiled artifacts emitted next to .storybook source files. The source is
# `preview.tsx` / `test-data.ts`; the matching `.js` / `.d.ts` / `.d.ts.map`
# were checked in by mistake and Storybook prefers them over the source,
# so edits to `preview.tsx` silently fail to apply. Keep these out of git.
.storybook/preview.js
.storybook/preview.d.ts
.storybook/preview.d.ts.map
.storybook/test-data.js
.storybook/test-data.d.ts
.storybook/test-data.d.ts.map
